#: setup.php
msgid "ERROR - Log errors only"
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE - Kọ àwọn àṣìṣe nìkan sílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "WARN  - Log errors and warnings"
msgstr "ÌKÌLỌ̀  - Kọ àwọn àṣìṣe àti ìkìlọ̀ sílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "INFO  - Log errors, warnings, and info messages"
msgstr "INFO  - Kọ àwọn àṣìṣe, àwọn ìkìlọ̀, àti àwọn ìránṣẹ́ ìfitónilétí sílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "DEBUG - Log everything"
msgstr "DEBUG - Kọ ohun gbogbo sílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios Host Mapping"
msgstr "Ìṣètò Olùgbàlejò Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the Nagios host that maps to this host."
msgstr "Yan olùgbàlejò Nagios tí ó bá olùgbàlejò yìí mu."

#: setup.php
msgid "NPC"
msgstr "NPC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Status Detail"
msgstr "Àlàyé Kíkún nípa Ipò"

#: setup.php
msgid "Service / Host Information"
msgstr "Àlàyé Iṣẹ́ / Olùgbàlejò"

#: setup.php
msgid "Command Execution"
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ Àṣẹ"

#: setup.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Gbogbogbòò"

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣẹ Òkèèrè"

#: setup.php
msgid "Allow commands to be written to the Nagios command file."
msgstr "Gba láàyè kí a kọ àwọn àṣẹ sínú fáìlì àṣẹ Nagios."

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios Command File Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Fáìlì Àṣẹ Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "The path to the Nagios command file (nagios.cmd)."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì àṣẹ Nagios (nagios.cmd)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios URL"
msgstr "URL Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "The full URL to your Nagios installation (http://nagios.company.com/nagios/)"
msgstr "URL kíkún sí ibi tí a gbé Nagios rẹ kalẹ̀ (http://nagios.company.com/nagios/)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Date Format"
msgstr "Ìlànà Ọjọ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the format you want for displaying dates."
msgstr "Yan ọ̀nà tí o fẹ́ fún ṣíṣàfihàn àwọn déètì."

#: setup.php
msgid "Time Format"
msgstr "Ìṣètò Àkókò"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the format you want for displaying times."
msgstr "Yan ọ̀nà tí o fẹ́ fún ṣíṣàfihàn àwọn àkókò."

#: setup.php
msgid "Portlet Refresh Rate"
msgstr "Ìgbàgbogbo Ìsọdọ̀tun Portlet"

#: setup.php
msgid "The amount of time in seconds to wait before the portlets refresh. The minimum is 30 seconds."
msgstr "Iye àkókò ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti dúró kí àwọn portlet tó sọ ara wọn dọ̀tun. Ó kéré jù ni ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 30."

#: setup.php
msgid "Host/Service Config Type"
msgstr "Irú Ìṣètò Olùgbàlejò/Iṣẹ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "The config type is based on whether or not you are restoring retained information when Nagios starts. If you are unsure just leave the default value. If you can see host and service groups but not hosts or services try changing this setting."
msgstr "Irú ìṣètò dá lórí bóyá o ń mú ìfitónilétí tí a dá dúró padà tàbí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ nígbà tí Nagios bá bẹ̀rẹ̀. Bí o kò bá dájú, fi iye àìyípadà sílẹ̀. Bí o bá lè rí àwọn ẹgbẹ́ olùgbàlejò àti iṣẹ́ ṣùgbọ́n tí o kò rí àwọn olùgbàlejò tàbí iṣẹ́, gbìyànjú láti yí ètò yìí padà."

#: setup.php
msgid "Host Icons"
msgstr "Àwọn Àmì Olùgbàlejò"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enable displaying host icons in the hosts grid. The icon_image and icon_image_alt parameters of the Nagios host definition are used to set the image. Icons should be 16x16 to get the best look. this setting does not affect the host status icons."
msgstr "Mú ìfihàn àwọn àmì olùgbàlejò ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àtòkọ àwọn olùgbàlejò. Àwọn pàrámítà icon_image àti icon_image_alt ti ìtumọ̀ olùgbàlejò Nagios ni a ń lò láti ṣètò àwòrán náà. Àwọn àmì yẹ kí ó jẹ́ 16x16 láti rí dáradára. Ètò yìí kò nípa lórí àwọn àmì ipò olùgbàlejò."

#: setup.php
msgid "Service Icons"
msgstr "Àwọn Àmì Iṣẹ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enable displaying service icons in the services grid. The icon_image and icon_image_alt parameters of the Nagios service definition are used to set the image. Icons should be 16x16 to get the best look. This setting does not affect the service status icons."
msgstr "Mú ìfihàn àwọn àmì iṣẹ́ ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àtòkọ àwọn iṣẹ́. Àwọn pàrámítà icon_image àti icon_image_alt ti ìtumọ̀ iṣẹ́ Nagios ni a ń lò láti ṣètò àwòrán náà. Àwọn àmì yẹ kí ó jẹ́ 16x16 láti rí dáradára. Ètò yìí kò nípa lórí àwọn àmì ipò iṣẹ́."

#: setup.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Ìkọsílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Ìpele Ìkọsílẹ̀"

#: setup.php
msgid "The level of detail you want sent to the Cacti log file. WARNING: Leaving in DEBUG will quickly fill the cacti log."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tí o fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́ sí fáìlì àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti. ÌKÌLỌ̀: Fífisílẹ̀ ní DEBUG yóò tètè kún àkọsílẹ̀ cacti."

